    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> for the unique bean of the given type from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> (which needs to be\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>). The lookup will produce a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException</code></a> in case multiple\nbeans of the given type are available in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> 类型在给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>（必须是\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>）中的唯一 Bean 的 <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a>。如果在给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中存在多个给定类型的 Bean，则查找将产生 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> for the unique bean of the given type from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> (which needs to be\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>).",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a>，用于从给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>（该工厂需要是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>）中获取给定类型的唯一 Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Simple helper to allow lenient lookup of beans of a given type from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>. This is not user\nfacing API but a mere helper for Spring Data configuration code.",
      "translation": "一个简单的辅助工具，允许以宽松的方式从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a> 中查找给定类型的 Bean。这不是面向用户的 API，而仅仅是 Spring Data 配置代码的辅助工具。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> to look up the bean from.",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 用于从中查找 Bean 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> for the unique bean of the given type or the instance provided by the fallback in case no\n        bean of the given type can be found.",
      "translation": "一个<a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a>，用于给定类型的唯一 Bean，或者在找不到给定类型的 Bean 时使用回退提供的实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Oliver Gierke",
      "translation": "奥利弗·吉尔克",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
